        "Content": "***2 BEDROOM COTTAGE ON C.1.1 ACRES***\r\n\r\nThis property is being sold via online auction with Offr.\r\nYou must register as a bidder prior to this auction.\r\nYou can visit the property via the following link: https://offr.io/property/gurranreigh-lissarda-macroom-cork-p14td65/162500\r\nThis will allow bidders to register directly on the property page.\r\nOnce your registration has been completed and deposit has been paid, you are ready to bid for this property on Monday 12th October 2026 @ 3:00pm\r\n\r\nKillian Lynch auctioneers are pleased to offer this traditional 2-bedroom cottage on C.1.1 acres. The property which is in need of renovation throughout extends to C.530 sq ft living accommodation and has the foundations completed for a large extension to the rear and side. The property has also the benefit of being vacant for more than 2 years and should qualify for a vacant home grant of up to €70,000. Located C.10 minutes’ drive from Kilmurry village, C.20 minutes from Macroom town and C.30 minutes from Cork city. Online auction via offr 12th October 2026 @3pm."
